wq#2039 — make /home/lumen/agent/signal_engine.py a self-documenting no-op.

Defence in depth only: remove-units.sh in this directory is the actual
retirement. This hunk stops a hand-run (`python3 signal_engine.py`) or a
restored unit from resuming a daily POST to a sink that was retired 2026-08-28,
and puts the reason where the next reader lands.

The file is 302 lines; both hunks use context read verbatim from the live file
on 2026-09-19. Apply from a lane with /home/lumen/agent in scope:

    cp /home/lumen/agent/signal_engine.py /home/lumen/agent/signal_engine.py.bak.$(date +%Y%m%d_%H%M%S)
    patch --dry-run -p1 -d/ < ops/wq2039-signal-engine-retire/signal_engine.diff
    patch -p1 -d/ < ops/wq2039-signal-engine-retire/signal_engine.diff
    python3 -m py_compile /home/lumen/agent/signal_engine.py

